# Dev / listing assets (screenshots, GIFs, internal notes); also excluded from addon zips via .pkgmeta
# (`docs/*` + negation instead of `docs/`: on case-insensitive filesystems this rule
# also matches the tracked Docs/ tree, and a wholly-excluded parent dir cannot be re-included)
docs/*
!docs/Engineering/


# Generated release artifacts (local review only)
.release/discord-release-payload.json

